{"title": "Grease Bottle", "pageid": 3829, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Grease_Bottle", "categories": ["Grenades", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/Grease\" title=\"Grease\">Grease</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Grease_(surface)\" title=\"Grease (surface)\">Grease (surface)</a>      </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:GRN_Grease_Bottle_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/GRN_Grease_Bottle_Faded.png/300px-GRN_Grease_Bottle_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/8/88/GRN_Grease_Bottle_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Grease Bottle image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/GRN_Grease_Bottle_Faded.png/300px-GRN_Grease_Bottle_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/GRN_Grease_Bottle_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Grease Bottle</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Consumables\" title=\"Consumables\">Consumable</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Grenades\" title=\"Grenades\">Grenade</a>) item which can be <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/25px-Throw_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/38px-Throw_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/50px-Throw_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"thrown\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/25px-Throw_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\">thrown</a> to create a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Grease_(surface)\" title=\"Grease (surface)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Grease_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Grease_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Grease_surface_Icon.webp/38px-Grease_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Grease_surface_Icon.webp/50px-Grease_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Grease\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Grease_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Grease_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f3/Grease_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Grease_(surface)\" title=\"Grease (surface)\">Grease</a> surface.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>The pale sludge within this bottle doesn't pour easily, oozing out in fatty clumps instead.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\